---
<Layout webflowPageId="6ac7be5cbe26577e22ffcf6d" pageTitle="AI Group Therapy Notes | Soulside Groups AI" pageDescription="Soulside identifies up to 16 speakers in group sessions and generates individual, payer-aligned notes for every member, pushed to your EHR in one click." data-wf-id="60d3f7b8b0e86c28630fc6d6" data-w-id="60d3f7b8b0e86c28630fc6d6">
<div data-wf-id="d24e5ea8-78da-f5b7-6dab-ac39945b55b0" data-w-id="d24e5ea8-78da-f5b7-6dab-ac39945b55b0" class="page-wrapper">
<GlobalEmbeds />
<GlobalAnnouncementBar />
<GlobalNavbar />
<main data-wf-id="dcf94f42-feae-15fa-9712-17acf0a0a835" data-w-id="dcf94f42-feae-15fa-9712-17acf0a0a835" class="main-wrapper">
<Section sectionFadeInAnimation={true} sectionColorScheme="lightest" sectionSidePadding="global" sectionBottomPadding="large" sectionTopPadding="small">
<Layout2 verticalAlignment="center" rowGap="xxlarge" columnGap="medium" layout="columns">
<ElementImage imageParallax={false} imageBorderRadius="medium" imageFile={{"id": "6acfbb7d15ec1bd51cba675f"}} />
<ElementContentGroup slot="content-first" contentGap="small" contentTextWrap="balance" bodyRichTextFontSize="large" bodyRichTextTag="p" headingHeadingMaxWidth="large" headingStyle="h1" headingTag="h1" contentMaxWidth="xlarge" contentAlignment="left">
<GlobalDemoButton />
<ButtonGlobal trailingIconVisibility={false} link="#helps" text="How Soulside AI Helps" style="secondary" />
<Fragment slot="bodyrichtext">Most AI documentation tools fail in group settings. Soulside is built for it — automatically identifying up to 16 speakers, generating individual member notes simultaneously, and capturing everything your payor needs.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="headingtext">The hardest problem in behavioral health, solved.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="taglinetext">Group AI</Fragment>
</ElementContentGroup>
</Layout2>
</Section>
<Section sectionColorScheme="lighter">
<Layout2 layout="stack">
<ElementComparisonTable>
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check">
Up to 16 speakers auto-identified
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check">
Group notes generated instantaneously on each client, in unison
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check">
Clinical themes tracked per participant
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check">
Group health dashboard and analytics
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check">
Payor-aligned documentation from day one
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem slot="content">
Single transcript with no speaker attribution
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem slot="content">
Group notes manually written on each client after hours
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem slot="content">
Can't separate individual clinical themes
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem slot="content">
No group-level analytics or program visibility
</ElementComparisonItem>
<ElementComparisonItem slot="content">
Not designed for multi-speaker payor requirements
</ElementComparisonItem>
<Fragment slot="label2">Soulside Groups AI</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="label1">Generic AI scribe</Fragment>
</ElementComparisonTable>
<ElementContentGroup slot="content-first" contentTextWrap="balance" buttonGroupVisibility={false} bodyRichTextFontSize="medium" bodyRichTextTag="p" contentMaxWidth="large" contentAlignment="center">
<Fragment slot="bodyrichtext">When you have 12 clients and one facilitator in a room, a standard AI scribe produces one indistinguishable transcript, useless for individual clinical documentation.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="headingtext">Generic scribes fail in groups. Every time.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="taglinetext">The Problem</Fragment>
</ElementContentGroup>
</Layout2>
</Section>
<Section sectionId="helps">
<Layout2 layout="stack">
<LayoutGridSlot gridSlotColumnsMobileL={1} gridSlotColumnsTablet={1} gridSlotColumnsDesktop={2} gridSlotGapTabletDown="xxsmall" gridSlotGapDesktop="medium">
<div data-wf-id="2fe3a89d-ab1f-4e21-2ea9-6ba72dc0d7a0" data-w-id="2fe3a89d-ab1f-4e21-2ea9-6ba72dc0d7a0" class="security_vertical-list">
<div data-wf-id="f16136ec-8f2e-7495-f41a-42bebe4fad05" data-w-id="f16136ec-8f2e-7495-f41a-42bebe4fad05" class="content-card">
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check---text-size-medium">
Session runs as normal. No devices on the table. No disruption to the group dynamic. Soulside captures in the background, automated and unobtrusive.
</ElementComparisonItem>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="71002bf4-d1fe-ffd3-b12d-ca5052aa34ca" data-w-id="71002bf4-d1fe-ffd3-b12d-ca5052aa34ca" class="content-card">
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check---text-size-medium">
Up to 16 speakers identified. Speaker identification separates and tags each participant's contributions automatically throughout the session.
</ElementComparisonItem>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="ec23aa36-b046-5ad7-02f2-b3be7d66fe10" data-w-id="ec23aa36-b046-5ad7-02f2-b3be7d66fe10" class="content-card">
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check---text-size-medium">
Individual notes generated. Each member gets a complete note, participation, clinical themes, and all required discrete fields, simultaneously.
</ElementComparisonItem>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="cc0a5d67-fec7-5fa0-a3c9-bc4ed969ed37" data-w-id="cc0a5d67-fec7-5fa0-a3c9-bc4ed969ed37" class="content-card">
<ElementComparisonItem variant="check---text-size-medium">
Push to EHR in one click. Clinician reviews, approves, and transfers all notes to the EHR before the next session begins
</ElementComparisonItem>
</div>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="2fe3a89d-ab1f-4e21-2ea9-6ba72dc0d7a5" data-w-id="2fe3a89d-ab1f-4e21-2ea9-6ba72dc0d7a5" class="full-height_image">
<img src={__lumosAsset45} loading="lazy" alt="" data-wf-id="5e29f4f5-103d-eb10-114c-0eabc30e33de" data-w-id="5e29f4f5-103d-eb10-114c-0eabc30e33de" class="cover-image" />
</div>
</LayoutGridSlot>
<ElementContentGroup slot="content-first" bodyPlainTextFontSize="medium" contentTextWrap="balance" buttonGroupVisibility={false} bodyRichTextFontSize="medium" bodyRichTextTag="p" bodyVisibility={true} taglineVisibility={false} contentMaxWidth="large" contentAlignment="center">
<Fragment slot="bodyrichtext">From session start to completed notes in the EHR, Soulside handles every step automatically.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="headingtext">Four steps. Zero post-session work.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="taglinetext">The Problem</Fragment>
</ElementContentGroup>
</Layout2>
