<Fragment slot="headingtext">Group health dashboard</Fragment>
</ElementContentGroup>
<ElementContentGroup buttonGroupVisibility={false} bodyRichTextTag="p" headingStyle="h4" taglineVisibility={false}>
<Fragment slot="bodyrichtext">Individual participation history and clinical themes visible at the member level, across multiple sessions over time.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="headingtext">Member-level tracking</Fragment>
</ElementContentGroup>
<ElementContentGroup buttonGroupVisibility={false} bodyRichTextTag="p" headingStyle="h4" taglineVisibility={false}>
<Fragment slot="bodyrichtext">Know when group notes are complete, flagged, or pending review, across every facilitator in your program.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="headingtext">Session completion rates</Fragment>
</ElementContentGroup>
</div>
</LayoutGridSlot>
<ElementContentGroup slot="content-first" bodyPlainTextFontSize="medium" contentTextWrap="balance" buttonGroupVisibility={false} bodyRichTextFontSize="medium" bodyRichTextTag="p" bodyVisibility={true} contentMaxWidth="xlarge" contentAlignment="center">
<Fragment slot="bodyrichtext">Groups AI includes program-level visibility, not just note generation. Track participation trends, group health, and documentation completeness across your entire program.</Fragment>
<Fragment slot="headingtext">See what's happening across all your groups.</Fragment>
